{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18871","headline":"将赴汝州途出浚下留辞李相公 · 刘禹锡","name":"将赴汝州途出浚下留辞李相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安旧游四十载，鄂渚一别十四年。\n後来富贵已零落，岁寒松柏犹依然。\n初逢贞元尚文主，云阙天池共翔舞。\n相看却数六朝臣，屈指如今无四五。\n夷门天下之咽喉，昔时往往生疮疣。\n联翩旧相来镇压，四海吐纳皆通流。\n久别凡经几多事，何由说得平生意。\n千思万虑尽如空，一笑一言真可贵。\n世间何事最殷勤，白头将相逢故人。\n功成名遂会归老，请问东山爲近邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}